# docker/Dockerfile builds from the REPO ROOT so it can read pyproject.toml. The repo is not baked
# into the image, so the context is deny-all plus the four files the build reads. Without this the
# daemon tars 1.5 GB (1.4 GB of it profiling/) on every build. A new COPY needs a new line here.
**

!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!fold_cp_ops/_version.py
!docker/image_gate.py
